    "description": "Unique opportunity for an investor or owner/user to update this Potrero Hill triplex! All units will be delivered vacant. The top floor flat offers views of Downtown from its traditional bay windows. This spacious 3 bedroom flat has a versatile split-bath with upgrade potential. In-unit laundry and a deck with garden access are also found here.   The middle unit is a 2 bedroom flat with a split-bath. At the rear, an open kitchen and dining space provides access to a deck and the yard. A garden level junior 1 bed and 1 bath is ready for your imagination. Walk out to the fenced garden with mature trees. A large 1 car garage rounds out the ground floor. Located on a tree-lined street, nearby amenities include the shops and restaurants of 18th Street plus Jackson Park & Playground. Easy freeway access makes this a great location for commuters!"
